viewedText": {"issues": [], "skipped": true, "summary": "自动文案质检已关闭，当前结果未经自动质检。", "decision": "PASS", "schemaVersion": 1}}, "research": {"query": "OPPO手机适合华为fit4还是红米watch6", "status": "COMPLETED", "sources": [{"url": "https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/content/zh-cn16047922/", "title": "consumer.huawei.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "consumer.huawei.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T07:15:51.680Z"}, {"url": "https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/wearables/watch-fit4/specs/", "title": "consumer.huawei.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "consumer.huawei.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T07:15:51.680Z"}, {"url": "https://www.mi.com/global/product/redmi-watch-6-nfc/specs/", "title": "www.mi.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "www.mi.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T07:15:51.680Z"}], "summary": "我会查一下两款手表对 OPPO/非自家安卓手机的兼容性、功能限制和当前规格，再直接给你选购结论。\\n更推荐 **华为 WATCH FIT 4**，即使你用的是 OPPO 手机。\\n理由：\\n- 两款都兼容 OPPO：均支持 Android 8.0 及以上，通过各自健康 App 连接。\\n- FIT 4 的运动、睡眠和健康分析更全面，华为官方兼容表显示，大部分核心功能在普通安卓手机上都能使用。\\n- 红米 Watch 6 优势主要是价格更低、屏幕更大、续航更长：普通使用约 12 天，轻度最长约 24 天。\\n- 两款接入 OPPO 后都没有自家手机那种完整生态联动；红米的米家设备控制等功能尤其依赖小米生态。\\n- OPPO 系统可能限制后台运行，配对后要把“华为运动健康”或“小米运动健康”设为允许自启动、后台运行，否则通知可能延迟。\\n简单选：\\n- 看重健康监测、运动记录和整体成熟度：**华为 FIT 4**\\n- 看重价格、大屏、长续航，只需通知和基础健康记录：**红米 Watch 6**\\n- 如果差价不超过约 300 元：我会选 **FIT 4**\\n- 如果红米便宜很多：Watch 6 性价比更高\\n需要注意：华为 FIT 4 的语音助手等少数功能可能要求华为手机；FIT 4 Pro 才有心电图和体温等进阶功能。[华为兼容性清单](https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/content/zh-cn16047922/)｜[FIT 4 参数](https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/wearables/watch-fit4/specs/)｜[红米 Watch 6 参数](https://www.mi.com/global/product/redmi-watch-6-nfc/specs/)", "attempts": [{"error": null, "status": "COMPLETED", "provider": "codex"}], "provider": "codex", "searchedAt": "2026-09-04T07:15:51.680Z", "schemaVersion": 1}, "thinking": "low", "imageCount": 4, "originalModel": "openai/gpt-5.6-sol", "reviewedModel": "openai/gpt-5.6-sol", "originalThinking": "low", "reviewedThinking": "low", "revisionAttempted": false}, "manualReview": null, "requestedImageCount": "auto"}	\N	\N	2026-09-04 15:18:34.548439+08
