车及5款汽油车后发现，电动车未必比汽油车宁静，小型家庭电动车样本车内宁静程度仅获3点或2.5点评分，而同类汽油车样本获3.5点评分；混能车及汽油车平均耗油量介乎每100公里5.6升至7.9升，二氧化碳排放量电动车样本较低，介乎每公里85克至110克。", "provider": "deepseek", "siteName": "香港消费者委员会", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-03T17:44:15.880Z"}], "summary": "围绕“汽油车和电车如何选择”，本次检索到的权威资料显示：选择应结合使用场景、成本、政策与长期价值综合权衡。工信部释放“坚持稳妥转型，同步推动内燃机技术发展”的权威信号，业内认为油车、纯电、插混/增程将长期并存；国务院发展研究中心专家建议缩小油车与电车补贴差距、错开购置税与补贴政策退出时间以体现公平竞争。从实测与调查看，中国质量协会测评显示新能源汽车在智能化板块优势更明显，智能化故障次数少于燃油车；香港消委会跨国测试则提醒电动车未必比汽油车宁静，混能车在能源效率上表现较好。具体建议上：城市通勤、家充方便者可选纯电，常跑长途或充电不稳定者可选插混/增程，偏远或重载场景仍可保留燃油车；政策层面海南2030年“禁售燃油车”但“禁售不等于禁行”，存量燃油车仍可正常上路。", "attempts": [{"error": null, "status": "COMPLETED", "provider": "codex"}], "provider": "deepseek", "searchedAt": "2026-09-03T17:44:15.880Z", "schemaVersion": 1}, "thinking": null, "imageCount": 4, "originalModel": "deepseek-v4-pro", "reviewedModel": "deepseek-v4-pro", "originalThinking": null, "reviewedThinking": null, "revisionAttempted": false}, "simulation": {"model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "enabled": true, "provider": "DEEPSEEK_RESPONSES"}, "manualReview": {"edited": true, "submittedAt": "2026-09-03T18:26:49.695Z", "baseRevisionId": 5, "reviewedByNodeId": "poker-01"}, "requestedImageCount": "auto"}, "revision": 2, "createdAt": "2026-09-03T18:26:49.694Z", "approvedAt": "2026-09-03T18:26:49.694Z", "executionId": null, "approvedByNodeId": "poker-01"}, "schemaVersion": 1, "productionSettings": {"production": {"value": {"modelApi": {"dotsModel": null, "textModel": null, "imageModel": null, "dotsBaseUrl": null, "reviewModel": null, "visionModel": null, "qualityModel": null, "imageProxyUrl": null, "modelProxyUrl": null, "imageTimeoutMs": null, "screeningModel": null, "copyGenerationProvider": null, "copyGenerationThinking": null}, "aiDisclosureText": "AI生成", "aiDisclosureEnabled": true, "qualityRepairEnabled": true, "qualityRepairMaxAttempts": 2, "qualityRepairTargetScore": 2, "qualityRepairTriggerScore": 1}, "version": 2}}}	DeepSeek Responses output is invalid	2026-09-04 02:26:53.330448+08	2026-09-04 02:28:08.887