 "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "consumer.huawei.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T04:11:19.624Z"}, {"url": "https://www.mi.com/global/support/faq/details/KA-694585/", "title": "www.mi.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "www.mi.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T04:11:19.624Z"}, {"url": "https://www.mi.com/global/product/redmi-watch-6/", "title": "www.mi.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "www.mi.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T04:11:19.624Z"}], "summary": "我会查一下两款手表与 OPPO/非自家安卓手机的兼容性、功能限制和当前定位，再给你直接建议。\\n如果搭配 OPPO 手机，我更推荐 **华为 WATCH FIT 4**，尤其重视运动、健康监测和佩戴舒适度时。\\n- FIT 4：27g、双频 GNSS，运动定位更强，健康数据体系更成熟；常规续航约 7 天。\\n- 红米 Watch 6：屏幕更大，常规续航约 12 天、最长 24 天，更适合追求性价比和少充电。\\n- 两款都支持 OPPO 安卓手机的通知、运动记录和蓝牙通话，但都需要把配套 App 设置为允许后台运行。\\n- 跨品牌限制：FIT 4 在 OPPO 上不支持智慧语音、遥控拍照等少数华为专属功能；Watch 6 的小米互联中心、通知聚焦等 HyperOS 功能也不能使用。\\n结论：**同价选 FIT 4；Watch 6 明显便宜，或你最看重续航和大屏，再选 Watch 6。**\\n另外，OPPO 的省电策略可能杀后台，安装“华为运动健康”或“小米运动健康”后，要开启自启动、后台运行并关闭电池优化。\\n来源：[华为安卓兼容清单](https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/content/zh-cn16047922/)、[FIT 4 规格](https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/wearables/watch-fit4/specs/)、[REDMI Watch 6 官方 FAQ](https://www.mi.com/global/support/faq/details/KA-694585/)、[Watch 6 官方介绍](https://www.mi.com/global/product/redmi-watch-6/)", "attempts": [{"error": null, "status": "COMPLETED", "provider": "codex"}], "provider": "codex", "searchedAt": "2026-09-04T04:11:19.624Z", "schemaVersion": 1}, "thinking": "low", "imageCount": 4, "originalModel": "openai/gpt-5.6-sol", "reviewedModel": "openai/gpt-5.6-sol", "originalThinking": "low", "reviewedThinking": "low", "revisionAttempted": false}, "manualReview": {"edited": true, "submittedAt": "2026-09-04T06:11:45.262Z", "baseRevisionId": 12, "reviewedByNodeId": "zxh1"}, "requestedImageCount": "auto"}, "revision": 2, "createdAt": "2026-09-04T06:11:45.250Z", "approvedAt": "2026-09-04T06:11:45.250Z", "executionId": null, "approvedByNodeId": "zxh1"}, "schemaVersion": 1, "productionSettings": {"production": {"value": {