", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T04:49:28.275Z"}, {"url": "https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/content/zh-cn15903440/", "title": "consumer.huawei.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "consumer.huawei.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T04:49:28.275Z"}, {"url": "https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/content/zh-cn16047922/", "title": "consumer.huawei.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "consumer.huawei.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T04:49:28.275Z"}, {"url": "https://www.mi.com/global/support/faq/details/KA-694585/", "title": "www.mi.com", "snippet": "", "provider": "codex", "siteName": "www.mi.com", "retrievedAt": "2026-09-04T04:49:28.275Z"}], "summary": "我查一下这两款手表与 OPPO 手机的兼容性和主要差别。\\n**OPPO 手机两款都能配，价格接近我更倾向华为 FIT 4；红米便宜不少、又想少充电，就选 Watch 6。** 不必因为手机是 OPPO 就排除华为。\\n- **选华为 FIT 4**：更看重轻巧、经常戴着睡觉。表体约 27 克、厚 9.5 毫米；配安卓手机也能使用主要运动功能，升级后还支持手表微信（要求 Android 9 及以上及对应软件版本）。[华为产品介绍](https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/wearables/watch-fit4/)、[微信支持说明](https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/content/zh-cn15903440/)\\n- **选红米 Watch 6**：更看重大屏和续航。配备 2.07 英寸屏幕，官方港版标称正常使用 12 天、轻度使用 24 天，实际取决于功能设置；支持安卓手机。[小米官方介绍](https://www.mi.com/hk/product/redmi-watch-6/)\\n**兼容不代表品牌联动功能全开**：华为的一碰传表盘不支持普通安卓手机，红米的部分跨设备互联需要澎湃 OS，OPPO 用不上这些。[华为兼容清单](https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/content/zh-cn16047922/)、[红米官方 FAQ](https://www.mi.com/global/support/faq/details/KA-694585/)\\n我的购买建议：**差价在两三百元以内选 FIT 4；差价更大、主要看通知和记步选 Watch 6。** 这是购买取舍建议，并非实时售价。", "attempts": [{"error": null, "status": "COMPLETED", "provider": "codex"}], "provider": "codex", "searchedAt": "2026-09-04T04:49:28.275Z", "schemaVersion": 1}, "thinking": "low", "imageCount": 4, "originalModel": "openai/gpt-5.6-sol", "reviewedModel": "openai/gpt-5.6-sol", "originalThinking": "low", "reviewedThinking": "low", "revisionAttempted": false}, "manualReview": {"edited": true, "submittedAt": "2026-09-04T04:53:08.407Z", "baseRevisionId": 13, "reviewedByNodeId": "zxh1"}, "requestedImageCount": "auto"}, "revision": 2, "creat